OL,3,GNEWSAFirework displays delayed due to
OL,4,Ashipping problems
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirework displays in Douglas and Ramsey
OL,7,Fhave been postponed by several weeks
OL,8,Fafter problems transporting fireworks
OL,9,Fto the Isle of Man.
OL,11,FRamsey's display, originally due to
OL,12,Ftake place on 31 October, will now be
OL,13,Fheld on 21 November, while Douglas's
OL,14,Fevent has been moved from 5 November to
OL,15,F26 November.
OL,17,FBoth displays will now help mark the
OL,18,Fstart of the festive season, with
OL,19,FDouglas staging a Christmas-themed
OL,20,Ffireworks display and Ramsey's taking
OL,21,Fplace the night after the town's
OL,22,FChristmas lights switch-on.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
